366.description:
This game is about a journey without a destination; at least at the outset, the player has no idea where they're going or why. The setting is Russia, where an epidemic has ravaged the region, killing many and leaving only a small number of survivors. The atmosphere is fitting: abandoned villages and towns, everything around is filled with darkness and danger.

Game features:
Survival doesn't always mean killing all the zombies, enemies, and so on. You'll have to survive in a different way — by finding food and shelter.
The game world's vast territory invites exploration; in addition to food, the user can find a variety of items.
Quests, riddles, secrets – the game progression is non-linear, with further events depending on the actions taken.
The game is being developed by Sergey Noskov.

Features of RePack
- Based on the release from PLAZA;
- Update 1.1 installed
- Nothing is cut out;
- Nothing is recoded;
- Installation time ~2 minutes;
- Tested on Windows 7 (x64) Ultimate;

883.description:
Russian company CivilSavages is working on a stealth horror game with role-playing elements. The project is called Dispatcher, and is currently in Early Access on Steam. Development is complete, but perhaps not quite yet — the creators encourage gamers to share suggestions for improving the project. "Dispatcher" is the name of a Russian spacecraft that set out into space to explore uncharted reaches. But by an unfortunate accident, the crew became trapped, and uninvited guests — alien monsters — came aboard. Or perhaps the incident was no accident? Gamers will have to find out, if they can survive...

About the plot
Yes, the plot for a horror film is not at all new, but for connoisseurs of the classic genre Dispatcher You'll definitely enjoy it. And the graphics, thanks to Unreal Engine 4, look quite good. The gameplay is based on careful, stealthy exploration of the ship, solving puzzles, and fighting monsters. To stay alive and achieve victory, you'll need to pay close attention to character development. Incidentally, the view is first-person, which enhances the immersion. And don't forget, there's still a terrible secret to uncover...

What features are worth downloading? Dispatcher via torrent?
- the atmosphere of space science fiction of the 1960s–1980s;
- a gripping cocktail of horror, stealth and role-playing;
- 5 unique character classes;
- 4 types of unpredictable monsters;
- an intriguing plot shrouded in a terrible secret;
- levels that are partly randomly generated;
- "hardcore" mode for those who are not afraid of monsters at all!

Installation
1. Install by mounting the image
2. Copy the contents of the "crack" folder to the folder with the installed game and replace them.
3. Play
